# SPA deep-link fallback for clean routes (/home, /labs/:slug, /admin, /runner/:id, ...).
# Cloudflare Pages Functions (under /api and /auth) always take priority over
# these rules, so their JSON responses are never rewritten to index.html.
/api/*   /api/:splat   200
/auth/*  /auth/:splat  200
/*       /index.html   200
